<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan sugar output seen well below year-ago.</title>
<headline>Pakistan sugar output seen well below year-ago.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani sugar output is likely to reach only 2.3 million tonnes in 1996/97 (July-June), compared to 2.47 million in 1995/96, an official of the Pakistan Sugar Mills Association said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
